{"book":"proverbs","lang":"en2","model":"glm-5.3","timestamp":"2026-08-30T00:22:29.505001232Z","verse":7,"ref":"proverbs 17:7","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":17,"translation":"Not fitting for a fool is a lip of excellence — indeed, how much less for a noble is a lip of falsehood.","tokens":[{"surface":"לא","gloss":"not"},{"surface":"נאוה","gloss":"fitting"},{"surface":"לנבל","gloss":"for a fool"},{"surface":"שפת","gloss":"a lip"},{"surface":"יתר","gloss":"of excellence"},{"surface":"אף","gloss":"indeed"},{"surface":"כי","gloss":"how much less"},{"surface":"לנדיב","gloss":"for a noble"},{"surface":"שפת","gloss":"a lip"},{"surface":"שקר","gloss":"of falsehood"}]}